   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "The intersection of A and B, written A ∩ B, is the set of elements that are in both A and B. Check each element of A: is it also in B? If A = {3, 4, 5, 6} and B = {4, 6, 8, 10}, A ∩ B = {4, 6}. If nothing is shared, A ∩ B = { }."
    }
   },
